- Logic confirmed correct: `items-stretch` is flex's default `align-items`, restoring it lets the `Cards` grid fill the parent's inline size so the `@container` breakpoints evaluate against real width. `HomeHero`'s centering is structurally unreachable by this change (sibling, not a flex child) — no regression possible by construction.
