Bash(git commit -m "$(cat <<'EOF'
fix(#59): stretch homepage cards wrapper instead of centering it

The div wrapping the homepage overview Cards used `items-center` on a
flex-col container. Cards (@fumadocs/base-ui) renders a CSS-container-query
grid (`grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 @container`), with each Card carrying
`@max-lg:col-span-full` for narrow containers. `items-center` sized the
grid by shrink-to-fit instead of stretching it to the parent's width, so
the @container's own inline size collapsed — producing the squished/
narrow layout instead of the intended 2-column grid.

`items-stretch` (flexbox's default align-items) restores full-width
sizing for the grid child, without affecting HomeHero (a sibling, not a
flex child of this wrapper) or the flex-col's main-axis centering.

Verified visually by extracting the actual dev-server-rendered DOM and
compiled Tailwind CSS and loading them into the sandbox's host Chrome via
a data: URL (playwright-mcp's browser can't reach the container's dev
server directly, and file:// navigation is blocked by default) — confirms
overlapping/collapsed cards before the fix and a clean 2-column grid after,
at both 1200px and 375px viewport widths.
EOF
)"
git status)
